/**
 * THE ROPE — INTERVIEW QUESTION BANK
 * ----------------------------------
 * Content layer for the interview simulator and Module 7 drills.
 * Integrity rules:
 *  - Every count shown in the UI is COMPUTED from this file plus the
 *    career graph (data/range/graph.js) at runtime — never hard-coded.
 *  - Role- and industry-specific questions are composed from the graph's
 *    documented directions (core skills, day-in-the-life), so coverage
 *    grows with the graph instead of being claimed in copy.
 *  - Coach notes teach candidates to answer with their own evidence.
 *    Nothing here scripts a fake persona or a memorised model answer.
 *
 * Shape:
 *  categories[] — {id, name{en,id}, desc{en,id}}
 *  questions[]  — {id, cat, lvl:any|entry|mid|senior, stage:any|screen|hr|tech|user|final,
 *                  d:1-3, sig:[star|metric|structure|research|honesty],
 *                  q{en,id}, tests{en,id}, coach{en,id}}
 *  followups    — trigger → {en:[..], id:[..]} (picked by the sim's answer analysis)
 *  roleTemplates / industryTemplates — composed against MT_RANGE_GRAPH
 *  cases[]      — difficult-situation paths: reframe → evidence → avoid
 */
